The underlying facts (species, biomes, enclosure requirements, taxonomy,
conservation status) originate from Frontier Developments' published Zoopedia
pages. Planet Zoo and Planet Zoo 2 are trademarks of Frontier Developments plc.
This dataset is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Frontier.
